    "description": "The visible brand name shown in the app bar, OS task switcher, and the header of the copied result text. Phase 7: this is the shop/brand name (ArtCasa Tiles), not the underlying app/codebase name (TileMate, used internally in pubspec.yaml and docs but never shown to the end user)."
