    "description": "Phase 9: the ArtCasa Tiles brand's own Arabic business descriptor ('for tiles and ceramics'), shown next to the brand mark on the home screen. Kept identical in all three locale files, same treatment as appTitle -- it's a fixed piece of brand identity (as authored in the original logo), not translated UI chrome."
